    skos:definition "Google's guide to reading and writing values describes the REST calls, with valueInputOption RAW or USER_ENTERED, that a program can make without EZSheets (Google Sheets API documentation, 2026)."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch15#S_RawRestCalls> ;
